    <article class="card"><h3>Evolved stars and masers</h3><p>Mapping small-scale structure, winds, and maser emission around late-stage stars.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h3>Astrometry and reference frames</h3><p>Exploring precision astrometric applications enabled by long baselines and stable calibration.</p></article>
